# WKB ↔ medium evanescent identity (2026-08-03)

## Algebra

$$\kappa = \frac{\sqrt{2m(V-E)}}{\hbar}$$

Thick barrier: $\ln T \sim -2\kappa L$.  Evanescent amplitude: $\ln|\psi(x)| = -\kappa x$.

At $x = L$, $2\,|\ln|\psi|| = |\ln T|$ (same $\kappa$).

